51
00:04:37,315 --> 00:04:38,097
This is Amr(عمرو).

52
00:04:38,862 --> 00:04:39,403
Sit down!

53
00:04:42,999 --> 00:04:44,856
So Amr Bin Abd Wud(عمروبن عبدود) called again,

54
00:04:44,896 --> 00:04:49,873
Isn't there a man among you, where's your paradise that you claim whoever dies among you will enter it?

55
00:04:49,929 --> 00:04:50,563
He is mocking now.

56
00:04:51,071 --> 00:04:53,968
Isn't there a man among you, who can stand up and face me.

57
00:04:54,976 --> 00:04:56,323
You claim that Jannah(جنة) is...

58
00:04:56,736 --> 00:04:58,553
come ahead and I'll send you in Jannah(جنة).

59
00:05:00,212 --> 00:05:03,242
