60
00:05:03,393 --> 00:05:04,219
Rasool Allah ﷺ told him,

61
00:05:04,259 --> 00:05:05,202
إنَّه عمرو

62
00:05:05,655 --> 00:05:06,838
Sit down! This is Amr(عمر)!

63
00:05:07,766 --> 00:05:08,623
